<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Forterre et al. (2005) Nature Doubly-Curved Shallow Shell Elastic Energy & Saddle-Node Cusp Catastrophe in Dionaea muscipula — MorphoEval overall 55.6/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 1 (v1) baseline evaluation of `2005-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling.py` (overall weighted score: 56.4/100). The baseline evaluates the closed-form zero-bias pitchfork equilibrium and 1D symmetric energy curve, but lacks full 2D coupled (kappa_x(t), kappa_y(t)) overdamped poroelastic + inertial snap dynamics across alpha in [0.2, 5.0], omits the three-stage closure kinematics (slow initial phase -> rapid 100 ms snap-buckling -> slow poroelastic damping), omits the cusp catastrophe phase diagram in (alpha, kappa_x0) and surgical curvature-relief strip cutting ablation, and does not segment the vendored Dionaea muscipula specimen image. Overall 55.6/100 (faithfulness 52.2, reproducibility 63.5); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 8871db0; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 58, Morphological realism / specimen match 46, Parameter expressivity 52, Morphometric validation 55, Source and data traceability 68, Code-to-model traceability 60, Reproducibility package 62. Output judged: docs/media/venus_flytrap_snap_buckling_comparison.png: rendered output of 2005-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling.py at 8871db0, image/png, 116318 B, 1610×672 px, artifact_sha256 044fe607a4b7f6329fb3419f7cc1895204f9bbd9f4e17607d772f0a61a68e9c9 (sha256 044fe607a4b7f6329fb3419f7cc1895204f9bbd9f4e17607d772f0a61a68e9c9), spec_fingerprint 09b1066fde1900adefad4e5592cdbc34803c6f1439dd9667ec1014d5137d4133. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 09b1066fde1900adefad4e5592cdbc34803c6f1439dd9667ec1014d5137d4133; artifact_sha256: 044fe607a4b7f6329fb3419f7cc1895204f9bbd9f4e17607d772f0a61a68e9c9; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/venus_flytrap_snap_buckling/dionaea_muscipula_trap_lobe_specimen.jpg=f2738290d66e4418..., datasets/venus_flytrap_snap_buckling/paper_citations.bib=f6ac2d52597b043c..., datasets/venus_flytrap_snap_buckling/scout_manifest.json=572531a0986c798e..., datasets/venus_flytrap_snap_buckling/venus_flytrap_snap_buckling_reference.json=593d9449e870fcf2...}." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Enforce runtime SHA-256 verification of all 4 dataset files, expand `measure_morphoeval()` to 9 quantitative reference-anchored metrics, and upgrade the figure to a 6-panel synthesis layout.",
        "remediation needed: Implement computer-vision segmentation of `datasets/venus_flytrap_snap_buckling/dionaea_muscipula_trap_lobe_specimen.jpg`, isolating the bilobed anthocyanin-red inner trap contour, central midrib hinge, bilateral lobe symmetry, and marginal cilia teeth.",
        "remediation needed: Implement full coupled 2D (kappa_x(t), kappa_y(t)) overdamped poroelastic + inertial snap dynamics and L-BFGS-B energy minimization of U(kappa_x, kappa_y) across alpha in [0.2, 5.0], reproducing the three-stage closure kinematics (slow initial convex phase -> rapid 100 ms elastic snap-buckling -> slow poroelastic damping).",
        "remediation needed: Implement the cusp catastrophe phase diagram in (alpha, kappa_x0) with analytical and numerical saddle-node fold boundaries kappa_x0_fold(alpha), developmental leaf-size scaling alpha = L^4*kappa_init^2/h^2 across juvenile/subadult/mature traps, and surgical midrib/curvature-relief strip cutting ablation (L_eff = L/3 -> alpha < alpha_c) eliminating snap." ;
    pk:hasScore 5.56e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

